# dev-autofix: a local-only Claude Code skill/loop for the monitor Linode dev
# box (dev.reliefinventory.app) that pulls TODO.md + /setup/feedback reports,
# groups them by page/component, and implements+tests fixes on autofix/*
# branches for human review via the read-only `devbox` git remote. Never
# pushes to origin itself. Deliberately never committed — deployed to that
# box by hand, outside the normal deploy pipeline.
/.claude/skills/dev-autofix/

